Under 15 USC 1681 section 604 a section 2, consumer reporting agencies are only permitted to furnish consumer reports based on the written instructions of the respective consumer. I have neither provided consent to ( Furnisher of information to credit agencies ) nor XXXX, XXXX, and XXXX to share my information. Any previous consent, whether explicit or implicit, is hereby revoked. 

